        "original_id": "638eb194-b6e4-5586-8b6e-dcd869c3bd38",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bebe Rexha, David Guetta, Nicki Minaj, Afrojack, G-Eazy, Martin Garrix\n- Products: \"Me, Myself & I\", \"Hey Mama\", \"In the Name of Love\", \"Take Me Home\", I Don't Wanna Grow Up\n- Concepts: Billboard Hot 100, featured guest vocals, debut extended play\n\nFacts:\n- I Don't Wanna Grow Up is the debut EP by American pop artist Bebe Rexha.\n- Bebe Rexha is best known as a featured guest vocalist on several Billboard Hot 100-charting songs, including G-Eazy's \"Me, Myself & I\", David Guetta's \"Hey Mama\", Martin Garrix's \"In the Name of Love\", and Cash Cash's \"Take Me Home\".\n- \"Hey Mama\" is a song by French DJ and record producer David Guetta that features vocals from Nicki Minaj and Bebe Rexha.\n- \"Hey Mama\" also includes production from Dutch DJ and producer Afrojack.",
